  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a kadhai over medium heat to 350 degrees.",
    "Deep-fry the fish pieces until golden brown and set aside.",
    "In the same kadhai, add more oil if necessary and saute the lemongrass, garlic, and ginger until fragrant.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the fried fish pieces, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 5 minutes or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Stir in the chopped mint leaves and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with additional mint leaves if desired."
